      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should first pinpoint the specific sections in the municipal code that create the conflict regarding setbacks and encroachments. Then, prepare a detailed argument demonstrating how the client's proposed mixed-use design respects the *intent* of the zoning code, even if it technically brushes against a contested clause. Finally, proactively request a pre-application meeting with the City Planning Department to gauge their initial stance on the conflicting language before formally submitting the variance application.",
