      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding the \"encroachments\" part, the adjacent lot has an old fence line that seems to violate the current setback requirements for R-1 zones. If we are trying to argue for a variance, how much weight should we put on documented historical encroachments versus the specific technical requirements of the new mixed-use application? I want to make sure we aren't overstepping our ground with the planning commission.",
