      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should present the historical encroachment as a factual context, not as the primary basis for your variance request. Focus your argument on how surrounding, pre-existing conditions—like the old fence—demonstrate the history and character of the neighborhood, which warrants a flexible application of the *new* mixed-use standards. Use the established encroachment to support a narrative of \"unreasonable hardship\" related to conforming to current regulations on that specific site.",
